WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:12.462
"Ooh," cried Pig.

2
00:00:12.463 --> 00:00:15.402
"I see apples!

3
00:00:15.403 --> 00:00:19.000
Lots of yummy apples!"

4
00:00:19.001 --> 00:00:21.668
It was fall.

5
00:00:21.669 --> 00:00:28.302
The friends were picking apples.

6
00:00:28.303 --> 00:00:39.059
"I want yellow apples," said Bat.

7
00:00:39.060 --> 00:00:44.043
"I want green apples," said Cow.

8
00:00:44.044 --> 00:00:49.431
"I want red apples," said Cat.

9
00:00:49.432 --> 00:01:03.544
"I want all the apples!" said Pig.

10
00:01:03.545 --> 00:01:13.638
The friends got lots of apples.

11
00:01:13.639 --> 00:01:16.925
Then Bat saw something.

12
00:01:16.926 --> 00:01:20.655
The thing was tall.

13
00:01:20.656 --> 00:01:25.672
The thing looked spooky.

14
00:01:25.673 --> 00:01:29.260
"What's that?" asked Cat.

15
00:01:29.261 --> 00:01:32.792
"It is a scarecrow," said Bat.

16
00:01:32.793 --> 00:01:38.798
"It scares the crows away," said Bat.

17
00:01:38.799 --> 00:01:42.764
"So they do not eat the corn."

18
00:01:42.765 --> 00:01:51.936
"Crows will not eat my apples!" said Pig.

19
00:01:51.937 --> 00:01:54.576
"Pig," said Bat.

20
00:01:54.577 --> 00:01:58.044
"Pig," said Cow.

21
00:01:58.045 --> 00:02:03.902
"Pig," said Cat.

22
00:02:03.903 --> 00:02:06.620
"Oops," said Pig.

23
00:02:06.621 --> 00:02:10.199
"They are not my apples.

24
00:02:10.200 --> 00:02:24.181
They are everyone's apples."

